OL,3,AStudent who stabbed housemate 30 times
OL,4,Aadmits murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA student who stabbed his housemate
OL,7,Fmore than 30 times in a masked ambush
OL,8,Fhas changed his murder plea to guilty.
OL,10,FZack Coughlan, 23, attacked Jamie
OL,11,FCollins, 21, in an alleyway near the
OL,12,Fgarden of their home on 8 April and
OL,13,Fthen left his body outside for eight
OL,14,Fhours before calling police.
OL,16,FA murder trial had been under way at
OL,17,FBristol Crown Court because Coughlan
OL,18,Finitially denied the charge, although
OL,19,Fhe did admit killing Collins. He told
OL,20,Fjurors he stabbed Collins because he
OL,21,Ffeared his housemate would kill him.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
